@PesaCore.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5235

### Create Account
POST {{PesaCore.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "accountNumber": "NEWACC001",
    "holderName": "New Customer",
    "balance": 5000.00
}

### Get All Accounts (No Includes - N+1 demonstration)
GET {{PesaCore.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts?include=none
Accept: application/json

### Get All Accounts (With Include - transactions included)
GET {{PesaCore.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts?include=transactions
Accept: application/json

### Get All Accounts (With Select - only IDs and AccountNumbers)
GET {{PesaCore.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts?include=select
Accept: application/json

### Get Account with Specific Includes (using query parameters)
GET {{PesaCore.Api_HostAddress}}/accounts/1?include=transactions&include=select
Accept: application/json
